# Everything else is tracked: aorus and the laptop sync through the private
# GitHub repo. Going public needs a fresh repo -- see pre-push.txt P6.

# Python Cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Everything the app writes is per machine -- settings, history, logs, recordings.
# vocabulary.txt is the exception: the same terms are wanted on every machine.
userdata/*
!userdata/vocabulary.txt
*.flac

# Secrets
.env
